
% Counting Stars

a: vi | I | V | IV |
link: vi | I | V | IV |
a_cad: vi | I | V | IV |
In: $a $a_cad
Vr: $a*2
turnaround: IV | R |
PCh: $a*2 $turnaround
Ch: $a*4
PCh_2: $a $turnaround
bridge: R | IV | ii | R |
ending: vi | I | V | R |
outro: $a $ending
S: [F] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $link $Vr $PCh_2 $Ch $bridge $Ch $outro
